  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Chop cauliflower into small florets.<br>• Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Drizzle <br>with olive oil, sprinkle with Mumbai spice <br>blend, season with salt and toss to coat.<br>• Roast until tender and brown around the edges, <br>20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83e4618d6e477003fca02/step-3b13cf00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, to a medium saucepan, add the <br>water and bring to the boil over high heat.<br>• Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and <br>reduce heat to low.<br>• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove pan from heat <br>and keep covered until rice is tender and water is <br>absorbed, 10 minutes.</p> <p><br>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so <br>don’t peek! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83e4618d6e477003fca02/step-48c20010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the rice is cooking, slice cucumber into <br>thin rounds.<br>• Pick and thinly slice mint leaves.<br>• Cut tomato into thin wedges.<br>• Roughly chop roasted almonds. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83e4618d6e477003fca02/step-734c7220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt <br>and mint. Season to taste with salt and pepper<br>and set aside. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83e4618d6e477003fca02/step-ccfd8d30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, <br>cucumber, tomato and a drizzle of white wine<br>vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83e4618d6e477003fca02/step-c9001740.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide rice, Indian-spiced cauliflower and <br>cucumber salad between bowls. <br>• Top with mint yoghurt and drizzle over tamarind <br>chutney. Sprinkle over roasted almonds to <br>serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d83e4618d6e477003fca02/step-67d66950.jpg"
    }
  ]
